{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人江嘉敏日前（10月31日）在深圳，完成人生首個舞台劇《等愛的女人》演出。</p><p>該劇是根據1994年香港電影作品《等愛的女人》所改編，江嘉敏演繹的角色就是當年由吳家麗所飾演的「陳冬梅」。</p><p>除了江嘉敏外，同劇還有唐文龍、呂慧儀、黎寬怡、黃潔恩（Kawaii）等演出。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:29.740385+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:01:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.868998+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.868998+00:00","content_hash":"b977799cf7142fd6cec48a5f4222de4219ac07fae36e8495e86a1a48b5ea5e47","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}